# autocuda data directory.
#
# Only `layout.md` — the machine-AGNOSTIC project description — is committed.
# Everything else here is per-host or per-run state that `/autocuda:discover`
# and the optimize skills regenerate:
#   - environment.md            (machine-specific: GPU, timings, noise, profilers)
#   - log-schema-optimize.json  (regenerated at the start of each optimize run)
#   - *-optimize-log.csv etc.   (per-run trial logs)
#   - gpu-count, worker-limits.csv, worktrees/, clones/, profiles/
*
!.gitignore
!layout.md
